category: Utils
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Limit process's absolute execution time"
ldesc: "timelimit executes a command and terminates the spawned process after a given
time with a given signal. A 'warning' signal is sent first, then, after a
timeout, a 'kill' signal, similar to the way init(8) operates on shutdown."
skip:

homepage: https://devel.ringlet.net/sysutils/timelimit/
